type ClusterMap map[string]*Cluster

// New ClusterMap type with validation methods
func (m ClusterMap) Validate() error {
    for name, cluster := range m {
        if cluster == nil {
            return fmt.Errorf("cluster %q cannot be nil", name)
        }
        // Additional validation logic here
    }
    return nil
}

type Config struct {
    // ... other fields
    Clusters ClusterMap `json:"clusters"` // Changed from map[string]*Cluster
    // ...
}
```

#### Validation Integration
The `Validate` function in `staging/src/k8s.io/client-go/tools/clientcmd/validation.go` currently iterates over the map manually (L174-176). This should be updated to call the new `ClusterMap.Validate()` method or maintain the loop while respecting the new type.

#### Conversion Logic
The conversion between `v1` (versioned) and `api` (internal) types in `staging/src/k8s.io/client-go/tools/clientcmd/api/v1/conversion.go` must be updated. Specifically, functions like `Convert_Slice_v1_NamedCluster_To_Map_string_To_Pointer_api_Cluster` (L28) will need to target the new `ClusterMap` type instead of the raw map pointer.

